    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2D / 3D Chess Game with new figures and various boards.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on boards with 5x5 to 16x16 fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 new Figures: Wizard, Gamma and Keeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ play modes: Single Layer, 3D Stacked Game, Random Attack Games, and Tower Challenge. Play chess or antichess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D and 2D views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level Editor and Community Presets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on one computer, online with your friends or against the AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional Anti-Chess mode for all single-level games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Stacked: Play on several levels: Each hit figure will be your trophy on the next level. Since a level is done (check or draw), the game continues on the next level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower Mode: Play several sized games. The best player wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online: Play against other users online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Game: Attach to online games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snapshots: Create a game snapshot and resume any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between different visualizations. Board Style, Darkmode, Fullsized Windows, hint fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy distribution of game sets between users.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimized for FullHD+ displays.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2D / 3D Chess Game with new figures and various boards.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on boards with 5x5 to 16x16 fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 new Figures: Wizard, Gamma and Keeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ play modes: Single Layer, 3D Stacked Game, Random Attack Games, and Tower Challenge. Play chess or antichess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D and 2D views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level Editor and Community Presets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on one computer, online with your friends or against the AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional Anti-Chess mode for all single-level games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Stacked: Play on several levels: Each hit figure will be your trophy on the next level. Since a level is done (check or draw), the game continues on the next level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower Mode: Play several sized games. The best player wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online: Play against other users online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Game: Attach to online games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snapshots: Create a game snapshot and resume any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between different visualizations. Board Style, Darkmode, Fullsized Windows, hint fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy distribution of game sets between users.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimized for FullHD+ displays.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "3D Chess with new figures, new game modes and complex boards-sizes. Play on 5x5 to 16x16 boards. New Figures: Wizard, Gamma and Keeper. Explore and discover a new chess. Play online, offline or against AI Single board games and hierarchical 3D games. Be the one that beats the most opponents.",
